## About

This folder should house all of the static `.ipset` blocklists that you wish to
have automatically included when the `master.ipset` blocklist is generated.

Each blocklist loaded in this folder may be any name, but the file must have the
extension `.ipset` in order to be included when your blocklist is generated.

These blocklists are loaded from the workflow script:

- `.github\scripts\master.sh`

## Structure

📁 .github
    📁 blocks
        📁 master
            📄 blocklist1.ipset
            📄 blocklist2.ipset